Z||000016||Monkeyman||12-30-1999||02:56 AM||||Cooter--Yes.  Trucker Buddys matches a truck driver with a classroom.  The write back and forth.  Kids can learn alot about geography and life in general through something like that.  I was a Trucker Buddy for about 5 years until I quit driving.  I can find the phone # (I know it's here somewhere) if you want it.||||reg||1
Z||000017||Call||12-30-1999||03:34 AM||||What service for cable modems were you looking at  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">? The cable modems around here start at 10 mbps and get slower as more people get on, and ADSL (with my service plan) is 384 kbps-1.5 mbps(depending on how close you are to the central office) and I live within 100 yards away from the central office (I got lucky) so I get anywhere from 800kbps-1mbps, it works really really well, the other week I downloaded the Ultima Ascension Demo and it was 500 megabytes, it only took me 1 hour, also the 1 megabyte a second isn't exactly how fast you get(I believe that is the speed to the central server), it is actually a little bit lower, but a 500 megabyte download in 1 hour, it was haulin some A$$!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">.||||reg||1
